{"4370300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exorcist Hotline", "steam_appid": 4370300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/bfa519e5e61e26f6786312d0b3d16944.poster.avif?t=1787775624\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/bfa519e5e61e26f6786312d0b3d16944.webm?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/bfa519e5e61e26f6786312d0b3d16944.mp4?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Banish demons with your friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the exorcists <strong>gather clues</strong>, its up to the hotliner to piece them together. Use your words to describe the haunted happenings and figure out the specific flavor of eerie adversary. Do your best to work together to perform complex rituals to <strong>complete the job.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/9069c095594cb109d1fad44482e00394.poster.avif?t=1787775624\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/9069c095594cb109d1fad44482e00394.webm?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/9069c095594cb109d1fad44482e00394.mp4?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terrifying demonic entities</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an array of <strong>unique horrors</strong>, each with their own behaviors, strengths, and weaknesses. But don't think you know whats up just because you've met this foe before. Each demon has their own personality and twist, keeping each investigation fresh. No jumping to the conclusion on a single clue. You gotta work for it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/58b851421da525bc5619e241c6c36364.poster.avif?t=1787775624\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/58b851421da525bc5619e241c6c36364.webm?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/58b851421da525bc5619e241c6c36364.mp4?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Business </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests and <strong>earn money</strong> to sustain your business. Buy equipment and base upgrades that will improve your team performance. Use extra money to decorate your base and make it your own!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/57699f557ab98d22d7641663446b8b94.poster.avif?t=1787775624\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/57699f557ab98d22d7641663446b8b94.webm?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/57699f557ab98d22d7641663446b8b94.mp4?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communication is your friend</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just scream pointlessly. Scream with purpose, because your friend is doing a bad job of describing colors and shapes. A game designed around a unique communication system that requires quick thinking and multitasking. Or you can just cheat and use discord, but then you have to live with that. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/c279463672f26d92d8a53f04f1948c6f.poster.avif?t=1787775624\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/c279463672f26d92d8a53f04f1948c6f.webm?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/c279463672f26d92d8a53f04f1948c6f.mp4?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature list</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 player cooperative friend-slop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying demons with unique behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable base with new equipment and swag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets to uncover</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/bfa519e5e61e26f6786312d0b3d16944.poster.avif?t=1787775624\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/bfa519e5e61e26f6786312d0b3d16944.webm?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370300/extras/bfa519e5e61e26f6786312d0b3d16944.mp4?t=1787775624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></stro